      "operative_body": "That Council and Committee meetings be held with Council members or Committee members in attendance in person or by electronic means, and that Council and Committee meetings be accessible to the public only by electronic means to ensure openness and continued transparency; AND THAT the changing situation with respect to public access to City Hall and the risks to the public and City Staff is deemed to be an administrative matter and responsibility for related decisions is delegated to the CAO or their delegate for regular City business, except for public attendance at Council or Committee meetings.",
